{%- comment -%}
  SHEENE OFFER BANNER

  Ye pehle index.json ke Custom Liquid block mein inline likha tha.
  Ab Custom Liquid block mein sirf ye ek line rakho:

    {% render 'sheene-offer-banner' %}

  Kya badla (speed):
  1. loading="eager" + fetchpriority="high" hata diya. Ye banner fold ke neeche hai,
     lekin high priority ki wajah se hero image se bandwidth cheen raha tha.
  2. hero-banner.png asal file 1.9MB (1971x907) hai. Ab srcset se mobile par ~768px wali jati hai.
  3. width/height asal file ke (1971 x 907). Pehle 1826 x 813 likha tha.

  File ka naam badalna ho to neeche BANNER_FILE badlo (Settings > Files mein jo naam hai).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign BANNER_FILE = 'hero-banner.png'
  assign BANNER_ALT = 'Build Your Own Bundle'
  assign BANNER_W = 1971
  assign BANNER_H = 907

  assign banner_url = BANNER_FILE | file_url
  if banner_url contains '?'
    assign sep = '&'
  else
    assign sep = '?'
  endif
  assign wbase = banner_url | append: sep | append: 'width='
-%}

<section class="exact-hero-banner">
  <img
    src="{{ wbase }}1100"
    srcset="{{ wbase }}480 480w, {{ wbase }}768 768w, {{ wbase }}1100 1100w, {{ wbase }}1600 1600w, {{ wbase }}1971 1971w"
    sizes="100vw"
    alt="{{ BANNER_ALT | escape }}"
    class="exact-hero-banner__image"
    width="{{ BANNER_W }}"
    height="{{ BANNER_H }}"
    loading="lazy"
    decoding="async"
  >
</section>

<style>
  .exact-hero-banner {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    margin-top: 25px;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    line-height: 0;
  }

  .exact-hero-banner__image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
  }

  /* Mobile: poori original image proportional rehti hai */
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .exact-hero-banner {
      width: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .exact-hero-banner__image {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      min-width: 0;
      object-fit: contain;
    }
  }
</style>
